# Branch naming

Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) §4, the canonical branch naming policy.

- Use a lowercase purpose prefix: `feature/`, `bugfix/`, `hotfix/`, `maintenance/`, `perf/`, `refactor/`, `docs/`, `test/`, or `ci/`.
- Follow it with a kebab-case description and a lowercase Linear identifier when available, e.g. `perf/coa-236-speed-up-page-transitions`.
- Never create or push a branch whose name starts with `t3code`. Rename tool-generated branches to a permitted name before committing or pushing.
